Root menu (`my/main-hydra/body`, Transient era). Submenu list lives in
`engine/menus.org` and derives from the leader registry — edit there,
not here. Owned file-open commands below.
** Owned commands
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(defun my/find-file (path)
  "Open PATH, expanding ~ correctly."
  (interactive "FFile: ")
  (find-file (expand-file-name path)))
#+end_src
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(defun my/open-dashboard ()
  (interactive)
  (switch-to-buffer "*dashboard*"))
#+end_src
